WEBVTT

00:19.260 --> 00:22.420
I'm surprised they reached the 
level of rank A adventurers

00:22.770 --> 00:25.520
within three months of 
being summoned to Sidonia.

00:25.990 --> 00:29.980
Sidonia will likely make
 their next move soon.

00:37.350 --> 00:40.370
Rejoice, our heroes.

00:40.730 --> 00:45.480
The time has come to introduce you 
to all the nations of the continent.

00:45.820 --> 00:47.730
Oh? Finally.

00:47.730 --> 00:49.360
It's a bit late, isn't it?

00:49.360 --> 00:50.510
<i>We're</i> the heroes, right?

00:50.510 --> 00:52.390
The ones who will save the world?

00:52.390 --> 00:57.560
All the more reason to wait to introduce 
you properly to the other nations.

00:57.950 --> 00:59.590
Now the time is ripe.

00:59.860 --> 01:01.250
Leave it to us.

01:01.250 --> 01:05.820
We'll show off, and prove we're the 
heroes of the Holy Empire of Sidonia!

01:06.400 --> 01:07.940
What is it, Akane?

01:07.940 --> 01:09.960
You don't seem too into this.

01:09.960 --> 01:11.410
Preposterous.

01:11.410 --> 01:14.160
Going around to each nation as the heroes...

01:14.160 --> 01:15.880
That's just amazing.

01:16.160 --> 01:19.210
Then you'll accompany the other two?

01:19.590 --> 01:20.960
Gladly.

02:52.540 --> 02:57.530
<b>Episode 11
Signs of Turmoil</b>

02:52.540 --> 02:57.530
<b>Episode 11
Signs of Turmoil</b>

02:52.600 --> 02:56.990
<i>The village we developed in the 
frontier area near Bolton</i>

02:56.990 --> 03:00.240
<i>was named Wedgefort by the lord.</i>

03:00.240 --> 03:03.610
<i>The road to Bolton was well built, and 
both the traveling merchants from Bolton</i>

03:03.610 --> 03:06.750
<i>and the soldiers stationed 
here passed through it.</i>

03:07.740 --> 03:11.660
<i>The villagers living here are learning 
from the craftsmen of Bolton</i>

03:11.660 --> 03:13.170
<i>as they construct their homes</i>

03:13.470 --> 03:15.190
<i>and begin blacksmithing.</i>

03:15.620 --> 03:20.080
<i>The crops are steadily growing, 
and it's  starting to look like a real town.</i>

03:21.240 --> 03:24.970
<i>It seems like the villagers are 
living fulfilling lives, too.</i>

03:32.940 --> 03:35.330
Sofia, look at this!

03:37.110 --> 03:39.700
It's a monster I've never seen before!

03:40.260 --> 03:41.860
A Bush Lizard?

03:42.270 --> 03:43.930
These monsters are here, too?

03:45.630 --> 03:48.590
It looks like the strength 
of the monsters is growing.

03:49.440 --> 03:51.430
They're getting stronger?

03:51.430 --> 03:54.330
Should I help exterminate monsters, too?

03:54.330 --> 03:56.170
I'll join you!

03:56.170 --> 04:00.110
No, they're not strong
 enough to cause me trouble.

04:00.500 --> 04:04.260
It's just... however slight it may be, 
they are getting stronger.

04:04.610 --> 04:08.600
Also, we're seeing monsters 
that we've never seen before.

04:08.600 --> 04:10.930
Like that lizard we saw today?

04:10.930 --> 04:16.340
I believe monsters from nearby habitats
have started moving toward us.

04:16.780 --> 04:18.730
Why would they suddenly do that?

04:18.730 --> 04:20.560
I don't have any proof,

04:20.860 --> 04:25.320
but I believe that unusual fluctuation of mana 
we felt nearly three months ago is the cause.

04:25.320 --> 04:31.020
At the very least, I think we can assume 
it's had some kind of effect on the monsters.

04:32.020 --> 04:35.440
<i>If what Lady Nolyn said was true,</i>

04:35.440 --> 04:38.220
<i>then that was the hero summoning.</i>

04:41.050 --> 04:44.830
Barack has requested that you return.

04:44.830 --> 04:46.180
He has a quest for you.

04:46.920 --> 04:48.120
Understood.

04:48.580 --> 04:50.960
Has anything changed back in Bolton?

04:51.280 --> 04:52.930
There's nothing new.

04:52.930 --> 04:54.810
But there is a rumor
making the rounds.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.150
A rumor?

04:56.620 --> 04:59.720
That the heroes have appeared 
in the Holy Empire of Sidonia.

04:59.720 --> 05:01.660
The heroes are in Sidonia?!

05:01.660 --> 05:04.770
That was about three months ago, right?

05:05.840 --> 05:07.120
How did you know that?

05:07.780 --> 05:10.570
Then that fluctuation of mana...

05:14.260 --> 05:19.550
What does it mean if the heroes 
were chosen to appear in Sidonia?

05:20.080 --> 05:22.260
It could be a good omen.

05:22.550 --> 05:29.140
Maybe the Goddess sent them to 
correct Sidonia's misguided policies.

05:31.010 --> 05:32.430
<i>She didn't.</i>

05:32.430 --> 05:34.540
<i>Sidonia wasn't chosen.</i>

05:35.810 --> 05:39.290
<i>They used forbidden magic and 
summoned the heroes themselves.</i>

05:40.330 --> 05:44.210
I hope the ones summoned are good people

05:44.210 --> 05:48.010
who will correct Sidonia 
as Maria suggested.

05:54.020 --> 05:57.260
We're counting on you, Heroes!

05:57.260 --> 05:59.920
May Anat's blessings be with you!

05:59.920 --> 06:04.340
Now, let's go show the world who we are!

06:05.940 --> 06:08.760
Hey. Is that one coming with us, too?

06:08.760 --> 06:10.380
M-My apologies—

06:10.380 --> 06:12.860
Don't you <i>dare</i> speak to me!

06:12.860 --> 06:14.720
Lulu is my attendant.

06:14.720 --> 06:17.910
Huh? You say "attendant," 
but she's a slave, isn't she?

06:18.310 --> 06:21.000
Now, now, what does it matter?

06:21.000 --> 06:23.440
You're so kind, Akane.

06:24.280 --> 06:25.880
Come on, Lulu.

06:31.410 --> 06:33.920
May Anat's blessings be with you.

06:38.370 --> 06:41.710
<b>Bolton, Adventurer's Guild</b>

06:38.960 --> 06:41.350
About Sidonia's heroes...

06:42.030 --> 06:44.430
We've heard there are two 
young men and one young woman,

06:44.430 --> 06:47.420
all with black hair and black eyes, 
making three in total.

06:47.420 --> 06:49.570
Black hair and black eyes?

06:50.270 --> 06:53.710
Apparently they're taking the heroes 
around to the Churches of Divine Light

06:50.610 --> 06:51.650
<i>No way.</i>

06:51.650 --> 06:55.170
<i>Were the ones summoned
Japanese like me?</i>

06:53.710 --> 06:56.500
in the Kingdom of Romalia 
and the Kingdom of Barcula.

06:56.500 --> 06:57.790
The churches?

06:58.260 --> 07:01.190
Well, the rumors likely aren't false;

07:01.190 --> 07:04.310
introducing them to the churches
is just a cover and they're actually

07:04.310 --> 07:08.490
targeting nations with many Church of Creation
believers, applying silent pressure.

07:08.880 --> 07:10.570
But, onto the main topic.

07:10.570 --> 07:13.320
The Papek Company has 
requested the Wings of Nolyn

07:13.320 --> 07:16.080
guard and escort them to the royal capital.

07:16.380 --> 07:20.110
If the Papek Company is asking 
for us, then we can't refuse.

07:21.470 --> 07:24.890
Would you mind taking me with you as well?

07:25.280 --> 07:26.840
With us?

07:26.840 --> 07:31.540
There's no guarantee that it'll be safe, 
since it's an escort mission.

07:31.540 --> 07:32.910
We shouldn't be too hasty.

07:33.490 --> 07:38.320
Staying behind in this mansion all by 
myself while all of you are gone...

07:38.320 --> 07:39.890
...would be lonely.

07:40.380 --> 07:41.890
It would be, yes.

07:42.150 --> 07:43.180
Maria?

07:43.850 --> 07:48.240
Having her stay all alone after coming 
to our mansion for the first time today,

07:48.240 --> 07:51.320
is the request that's too hasty.

07:51.320 --> 07:53.860
I understand how Máni feels, too.

07:54.390 --> 07:56.070
Hm...

07:58.170 --> 08:01.430
I can use earth magic as well.

08:02.050 --> 08:06.330
<i>P-Please don't look at 
me with such teary eyes!</i>

08:06.730 --> 08:08.050
Fine.

08:08.050 --> 08:11.790
In that case, Máni, I'll ask you to work 
with either Maria or Reyva.

08:11.790 --> 08:14.040
Then you'll take me with you?

08:14.040 --> 08:16.520
Let's get you registered 
with the guild tomorrow.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.150
Thank you so much!

08:20.710 --> 08:24.810
Damn! Can't anything be 
done about this rocking?

08:24.810 --> 08:27.030
Like adding a suspension!

08:27.030 --> 08:31.460
Apparently there are already carriages 
with suspensions in Barcula and Romalia!

08:31.900 --> 08:32.990
That reminds me,

08:32.990 --> 08:36.580
there are a lot of elves in the royal capital 
of Barcula that we're heading to next, right?

08:36.580 --> 08:38.250
Think we can take a few back with us?

08:38.250 --> 08:39.910
That's a great idea.

08:39.910 --> 08:45.200
Mr. Akira, Barcula forbids taking 
slaves out of the country.

08:45.200 --> 08:48.220
Oh, come on! We're the <i>heroes!</i>

08:48.220 --> 08:50.720
They should be overjoyed to come with us.

08:50.720 --> 08:51.710
Right?

08:51.710 --> 08:55.060
We're first-rate adventurers 
well past level 30,

08:55.060 --> 08:59.870
and soon there won't be anyone on the 
continent who can measure up to us.

08:59.870 --> 09:02.000
<i>This expedition is my only chance.</i>

09:02.000 --> 09:03.400
<i>I have to do something.</i>

09:04.710 --> 09:08.270
<i>Bakilatos, the royal capital of Barcula,</i>

09:08.270 --> 09:11.440
<i>will have something I can use 
to turn this situation right.</i>

09:11.440 --> 09:13.110
<i>That's the feeling I'm getting.</i>

09:13.540 --> 09:17.670
<i>I'm sure it's my Revelation skill 
trying to tell me something!</i>

09:19.070 --> 09:22.040
<b>Kingdom of Barcula, Royal Capital Bakilatos</b>

09:22.360 --> 09:23.860
You've completed the quest.

09:23.860 --> 09:26.720
Takumi and Sofia will be promoted to rank A,

09:26.720 --> 09:29.640
and Máni to rank D,

09:29.640 --> 09:31.720
so please let us have your guild cards.

09:32.340 --> 09:34.430
Hey, make way!

09:34.780 --> 09:36.470
What's wrong with you all?

09:36.890 --> 09:38.500
You're in the way. Move.

09:38.500 --> 09:40.230
Haven't seen you around before.

09:40.230 --> 09:41.260
You new?

09:41.260 --> 09:42.960
I told you to <i>move!</i>

09:46.100 --> 09:50.370
Talk back to the heroes and 
this is what happens.

09:50.370 --> 09:53.340
Oh, look. It's an elf!

09:53.340 --> 09:57.830
Hey, Akira, that
bunny-eared one's super sexy!

09:57.830 --> 10:01.030
Hey! I'll buy that woman off of you.

10:01.030 --> 10:02.750
Consider it an honor.

10:02.750 --> 10:05.260
This is a direct request from the heroes.

10:05.260 --> 10:06.370
No way.

10:06.630 --> 10:07.640
What?

10:07.640 --> 10:10.340
If that's all, then please leave.

10:10.340 --> 10:14.200
Hey, do you think you can defy us?

10:14.200 --> 10:16.140
Just hand over your women quietly.

10:16.140 --> 10:17.820
Stop it, you two!

10:17.820 --> 10:19.360
Don't embarrass us like this!

10:19.360 --> 10:20.820
You be quiet, Akane!

10:21.580 --> 10:22.530
The two of you,

10:22.530 --> 10:24.260
come with us.

10:24.550 --> 10:29.570
Unfortunately, we have
 no intention of leaving our master.

10:29.570 --> 10:31.360
Same here.

10:32.430 --> 10:33.600
Why, you!

10:33.950 --> 10:35.680
I'll ask you once more.

10:35.680 --> 10:36.700
Please leave.

10:36.700 --> 10:37.810
Screw you!

10:37.810 --> 10:39.360
Don't you dare insult us like that!

10:41.050 --> 10:42.080
Decomposition.

10:42.770 --> 10:43.660
<i>What?!</i>

10:44.240 --> 10:45.950
Why, you!

10:50.640 --> 10:52.350
My holy sword!

10:52.350 --> 10:53.800
<i>No, it's not.</i>

10:53.800 --> 10:55.660
<i>It's an ordinary sword made from magic iron.</i>

10:56.100 --> 10:57.220
Why you!

10:57.220 --> 11:01.400
You think opposing the Heroes of Sidonia 
is going to end well for you?!

11:01.400 --> 11:04.030
Which of us is this going to end poorly for?

11:07.090 --> 11:09.710
Do you understand what it 
means to draw your sword

11:09.710 --> 11:11.880
and attack someone in 
the Adventurer's Guild?

11:13.340 --> 11:16.200
You'll regret it if you oppose 
the Church of Divine Light!

11:16.200 --> 11:19.100
We'll remember you!

11:19.100 --> 11:20.410
Beat it, already.

11:20.410 --> 11:21.660
Tsk, damn right you're leaving.

11:22.550 --> 11:24.500
I'm so sorry about them.

11:24.960 --> 11:27.490
You don't need to apologize.

11:28.000 --> 11:30.570
Would you mind telling me your name?

11:30.570 --> 11:31.880
My name?

11:31.880 --> 11:34.840
I'm Akane Misato.

11:37.140 --> 11:40.760
I'm the leader of the 
Wings of Nolyn, Takumi Iruma.

11:41.660 --> 11:43.090
Takumi?

11:43.090 --> 11:45.010
Hey, are you—?!

11:45.470 --> 11:48.350
Ms. Akane, we need to hurry.

11:48.970 --> 11:51.480
I plan on staying at the Lakeside Hotel.

11:56.410 --> 11:58.580
<i>Takumi Iruma!</i>

11:58.580 --> 11:59.970
<i>He's the one.</i>

11:59.970 --> 12:03.580
<i>That's what my Revelation 
skill is telling me!</i>

12:05.630 --> 12:06.770
Huh?!

12:06.770 --> 12:09.240
You met the heroes?!

12:09.240 --> 12:11.600
They were truly uncouth cretins.

12:11.600 --> 12:13.460
They bring shame to the term "hero."

12:13.460 --> 12:16.720
They were looking at me and Sofia 
like they wanted to ravish us.

12:16.720 --> 12:18.720
Blech! Gross!

12:19.090 --> 12:22.550
However, the woman with them
at least seemed decent.

12:22.550 --> 12:23.360
Yeah.

12:23.840 --> 12:25.760
Maybe there's a chance she'll...

12:27.040 --> 12:31.950
I told her we'd be staying at this hotel, 
but maybe that was careless of me?

12:31.950 --> 12:35.020
It's alright! You have us—

12:35.020 --> 12:36.480
—with you!

12:36.790 --> 12:39.690
No, I wasn't referring to <i>my</i> safety...

12:47.920 --> 12:51.360
Ms. Akane, please leave me behind!

12:51.360 --> 12:53.750
No, you must come with me!

12:53.750 --> 12:54.680
There they are!

12:55.080 --> 12:56.120
Come on!

12:56.120 --> 12:58.540
Ms. Akane! Please come back!

12:58.540 --> 13:00.000
Ms. Akane!

13:06.260 --> 13:10.140
The hotel Mr. Takumi's staying 
in is just past this alley.

13:11.420 --> 13:12.390
Ms. Akane!

13:15.490 --> 13:16.410
Hurry!

13:19.780 --> 13:22.640
Good work, Sofia, Maple.

13:23.490 --> 13:27.520
I don't believe anyone realized 
these two were heading here.

13:27.520 --> 13:31.110
I bundled them all up in thread and left 
them hanging from trees in the woods.

13:31.380 --> 13:34.040
Thank you both so much!

13:35.220 --> 13:36.860
Takumi Iruma.

13:36.860 --> 13:38.820
I'm going to be blunt and ask,

13:39.440 --> 13:42.870
are you the descendant of the Japanese 
person who was summoned here?

13:43.170 --> 13:45.080
I can't let information leak to Sidonia—

13:45.080 --> 13:46.650
I swear I won't tell them!

13:49.750 --> 13:51.520
I'm Japanese.

13:51.520 --> 13:53.930
Huh? But your face...

13:53.930 --> 13:55.560
I'm Japanese, just like you.

13:56.220 --> 14:00.960
The reason I'm here is 
related to you all as well.

14:01.350 --> 14:03.490
Um, Mr. Takumi...

14:04.130 --> 14:06.200
I don't understand.

14:06.200 --> 14:08.440
It doesn't make sense to hide it anymore.

14:08.970 --> 14:12.690
I'd like you all to keep what
 I'm about to tell you between us.

14:14.290 --> 14:16.320
Akane and her slave are gone?

14:16.320 --> 14:17.760
She ran.

14:17.760 --> 14:22.180
I thought she was acting strange 
from the moment we left Sidonia.

14:22.180 --> 14:28.050
At any rate, we should cancel our next 
visit to Romalia and return to Sidonia.

14:28.050 --> 14:31.120
We'll have to review our 
plans at a later date.

14:32.710 --> 14:35.090
Then, Mr. Takumi,

14:35.090 --> 14:38.420
you come from the same 
world as the heroes?

14:38.420 --> 14:39.050
Yeah.

14:39.550 --> 14:42.960
Plus, you're here on Lady Nolyn's wishes?

14:42.960 --> 14:46.020
So you're a emissary from Lady Nolyn!

14:46.020 --> 14:51.120
Oh, uh, you all are accepting 
this so easily, I'm at a loss.

14:51.120 --> 14:53.910
So the Holy Empire of 
Sidonia is the villain.

14:53.910 --> 14:57.380
A summoning spell that caused such 
a drastic fluctuation of mana...

14:57.380 --> 14:59.910
That might have a detrimental
 effect on this world.

15:00.330 --> 15:02.060
I know, yeah.

15:02.470 --> 15:05.530
I've found a place for 
myself here in this world.

15:05.530 --> 15:08.300
I just want to live a 
quiet life as a producer.

15:08.960 --> 15:12.390
But Sidonia's hero summoning
 poses a problem.

15:12.390 --> 15:15.250
Do you think they're planning to 
go to war with other nations?

15:15.250 --> 15:16.810
That's possible.

15:16.810 --> 15:18.680
But even if they are heroes,

15:18.680 --> 15:21.520
I don't think they can 
wage a war on their own.

15:21.520 --> 15:24.450
Then maybe they'll be used 
to incite the masses?

15:24.450 --> 15:26.730
Yeah, that's more logical.

15:27.210 --> 15:30.700
Though if that causes the influence of 
the Church of Divine Light to spread,

15:30.700 --> 15:33.510
then it puts us in an even 
more precarious position.

15:33.510 --> 15:36.510
I'm sorry for getting you involved.

15:36.990 --> 15:40.400
No, we were both dragged into this.

15:40.400 --> 15:41.580
More importantly...

15:41.580 --> 15:44.340
Why are those other two acting like that?

15:44.620 --> 15:48.300
Akira and Yamato weren't 
like that at the beginning.

15:48.750 --> 15:51.910
Ever since we came here, 
their personalities have changed,

15:51.910 --> 15:53.870
almost to an unnatural degree.

15:53.870 --> 15:55.960
You think something was done to them?

15:56.600 --> 15:59.120
What did you all do for food and drink?

15:59.120 --> 16:02.600
I didn't trust Sidonia from the start,

16:02.600 --> 16:07.060
so I always cast purification magic 
before eating or drinking anything.

16:07.760 --> 16:11.190
But those two prioritized 
their swordsmanship,

16:11.190 --> 16:14.900
so they slacked off on raising 
their light magic skills.

16:14.900 --> 16:20.350
Then there may have been some drug in the 
food and drink that brainwashed them.

16:20.350 --> 16:21.710
Mr. Iruma!

16:22.280 --> 16:24.460
Please save me and Lulu!

16:24.940 --> 16:27.410
No, please, stop kneeling!

16:27.410 --> 16:30.520
I've been waiting so long 
for a chance to escape!

16:30.520 --> 16:33.240
Even if you're only willing to 
 take me to another country...

16:33.940 --> 16:35.280
Please!

16:36.060 --> 16:39.470
What do you plan on doing once 
you're in another country?

16:39.470 --> 16:40.980
You'll be hunted down.

16:43.510 --> 16:44.750
I...

16:45.320 --> 16:48.220
That's proof of your contract, right?

16:48.660 --> 16:49.810
Yes.

16:50.130 --> 16:52.200
I can't stand that either.

16:52.780 --> 16:55.500
Enslaving another person with a collar...

16:59.010 --> 17:00.090
Dispel.

17:04.120 --> 17:07.330
It sounds like this is 
what your master wants.

17:07.330 --> 17:10.700
Ms. Akane, um...

17:10.700 --> 17:13.670
I don't have anywhere else to go!

17:13.900 --> 17:14.870
Huh?

17:14.870 --> 17:17.510
Are you discarding me now?

17:17.770 --> 17:19.230
Please!

17:19.230 --> 17:20.940
Let me stay with you!

17:20.940 --> 17:24.360
Will you allow me remain with 
you for a while longer?!

17:24.360 --> 17:26.320
I promise not to get in the way!

17:27.190 --> 17:29.680
We'll be together, now and forever.

17:30.580 --> 17:31.890
But listen.

17:31.890 --> 17:33.910
It won't be as a slave or due to a contract.

17:34.590 --> 17:37.300
I want you by my side as a friend.

17:37.300 --> 17:38.620
A friend?

17:39.620 --> 17:42.390
I've wanted that for so long.

17:42.390 --> 17:46.750
Lulu, from now on, we're friends.

17:47.210 --> 17:49.620
Ms. Akane...

17:50.540 --> 17:53.750
For starters, we'll head 
to my mansion in Bolton.

17:54.260 --> 17:56.820
But then we'll be causing trouble for you.

17:57.640 --> 18:00.440
I can't just abandon my fellow countrymen.

18:00.840 --> 18:03.870
We should get away from the 
royal capital as quickly as possible.

18:07.900 --> 18:10.040
Here, have some.

18:10.040 --> 18:11.560
Is this...

18:11.560 --> 18:13.080
...cream stew?!

18:13.670 --> 18:17.550
I was shocked when I learned 
they had milk and cheese, too.

18:17.550 --> 18:20.070
I plan on obtaining some 
rice someday as well.

18:20.070 --> 18:22.530
Come on, have a seat, Lulu.

18:22.890 --> 18:24.990
I-I...

18:26.240 --> 18:28.200
Lulu, let's eat!

18:28.200 --> 18:30.210
Y-Yes!

18:31.010 --> 18:32.250
Time to dig in!

18:32.250 --> 18:34.000
T-Time to dig in...

18:38.630 --> 18:39.800
Akane?

18:39.800 --> 18:42.030
I-Is it bad?!

18:42.030 --> 18:44.510
I made the stew today!

18:44.510 --> 18:47.340
I've been leaving it all to Máni lately!

18:47.340 --> 18:50.760
Now I'm just salt water 
pretending to be cream stew!

18:50.760 --> 18:53.070
No, even lower than that!

18:53.070 --> 18:55.540
N-No, I'm the one who
cut the vegetables!

18:55.540 --> 18:57.230
I'm so sorry!

18:57.610 --> 18:58.990
That's not it.

18:58.990 --> 19:01.190
It's incredibly delicious.

19:02.060 --> 19:03.000
Huh?

19:03.670 --> 19:04.980
Ms. Akane?

19:05.380 --> 19:08.470
I thought I would never 
get to eat this again.

19:09.230 --> 19:10.700
<i>It's understandable.</i>

19:10.700 --> 19:14.160
<i>I'm sure she's been on edge the entire 
time since she was summoned here.</i>

19:14.680 --> 19:18.320
<i>So after getting a taste of home, 
she's finally able to relax a little.</i>

19:26.410 --> 19:27.650
Hm?

19:27.650 --> 19:29.760
What? The forest is swelling?

19:31.090 --> 19:32.560
It's a monster stampede!

19:32.560 --> 19:34.060
Get a messenger to Bolton!

19:34.060 --> 19:35.760
Hurry!

19:39.310 --> 19:46.210
<i>I planned to talk with His Majesty through 
the lord about Akane and Lulu tomorrow,</i>

19:46.210 --> 19:50.530
<i>since they would be safe here 
in the mansion for a while.</i>

19:52.190 --> 19:57.110
Reyva, I'm sorry, but could you go 
call Sofia and the others for me?

19:57.110 --> 19:59.650
Yes... of course.

20:00.790 --> 20:04.210
As of this moment, I'm dissolving 
everyone's contract.

20:04.900 --> 20:09.490
Going forward, I'm going to find myself 
at the center of even greater danger.

20:10.320 --> 20:11.690
Mr. Takumi!

20:11.690 --> 20:14.210
You're spouting this nonsense again?!

20:14.210 --> 20:15.450
Again?

20:15.450 --> 20:17.150
He's done this before?

20:17.150 --> 20:20.600
Yes, he has! And Maria snapped at him!

20:20.600 --> 20:22.390
Of course I would!

20:22.940 --> 20:23.970
Hold on.

20:23.970 --> 20:25.510
Let me finish.

20:25.510 --> 20:26.530
This time it's different.

20:26.780 --> 20:30.740
Going forward, I want you all 
at my side in a different way.

20:31.040 --> 20:32.890
A different way?

20:32.890 --> 20:36.410
As my allies, my precious friends—

20:36.410 --> 20:38.590
no, my family?

20:38.960 --> 20:41.550
It's been a year since 
I met Sofia and Maria,

20:41.550 --> 20:45.260
six months with Reyva, 
and three months with Máni.

20:45.260 --> 20:48.860
You've all done really great things, 
and I'm grateful for you.

20:48.860 --> 20:55.010
That's why I thought, we don't need 
any contracts between us anymore,

20:55.010 --> 20:58.180
because there's already a stronger, 
firmer bond between us.

20:58.820 --> 21:00.050
A bond...

21:00.770 --> 21:04.580
I want you to all to support 
me as my partners.

21:05.590 --> 21:07.710
So we can remain at your side?

21:08.550 --> 21:09.680
Of course!

21:11.080 --> 21:13.160
Alright, then step forward.

21:14.700 --> 21:17.990
No, we never forged a contract, Máni.

21:18.390 --> 21:21.490
It kind of feels like I'm missing out.

21:24.250 --> 21:25.290
Dispel.

21:36.370 --> 21:39.580
I'm happy to have you 
with me, just as always!

21:44.840 --> 21:45.790
Done.

